============================service with NameSpace addressing==========================================
Read it as "the Service api, over in payments." That two-part form is the one to remember: same namespace, 
use the short name; different namespace, add the namespace after it. 
Kubernetes fills in the rest of the DNS name either way.

<service>.<namespace>.svc.cluster.local
simple command "api" will work if namespace is same , but api.payments need if namespaces are diff in this case payments namespace. 
